Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, time to slowly get\Ncrushed into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the nefarious Netherlord can't\Nsee me, which only changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, I'll cleverly spend\Nthe points I have left.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.78,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,310)\fad(191,1)\c&H724C3D&\3c&HE6DBD3&\shad0\fs15}Gas Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who's good as new?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These babies are used in dioramas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and according to my research, they're\Nthe smallest vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully the nether dork\Nthinks I kicked the bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd better camouflage\Nmyself just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he make a supersized\Nsummoning circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freak combined\Nall the Stratum bosses!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ruh-roh, that means this mad\Nmonster's packing peak power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nuntil the dungeon collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, as I entomb that foolish demon\Nlord and assert control over my own domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's how I wound up living\Nunderground for four whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bunkered up with telekinesis\Nand concrete blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus flowers for a splash of color.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is lonesome being\Nburied alive, but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Lamas will give\Nit her all to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Lamas, you've come such a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other hunters thought you were useless and\Nyou'd even been abandoned by your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that must have\Nhurt like the dickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But check out your glow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're an able hunter and a household\Nname in the Clearflow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've literally had your\Nback this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just thinking about\Nit gets me all verklempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me we could\Nstay together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this little mess is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt she'll help me conquer\Nanother dungeon to become human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the rest of the gang\Nwants to tag along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Road trip baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can keep adventuring with\Nthis rowdy yet lovable band of misfits,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, time for the yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show these meanies what\Nvending machines are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:03:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fox Show!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.70,0:03:29.75,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love it, to eat, to bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't see a crash, baby.\NI'm so sure I'm getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of this universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will get it.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.10,0:04:41.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx50\pos(526,55.4)}The Thumb General
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammis! Boxxo! Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, glad you're not squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's feeling worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have known you'd be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not broken, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or scratched up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're lucky to be in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't always have\Nto push your luck, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it too soon to ask you\Nto dish out some snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's been dug out, can you dig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew you'd make\Nit out of this, okay, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond a shadow of a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your humor leaves a lot to\Nbe desired, Director Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:05:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The directors are safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, where's the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's when.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, all of our friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.99,0:06:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear and the others are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pursuing the monster horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing my buddies are okay\Nis a huge load off my ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time to get vending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how the town was destroyed,\Nthere aren't a ton of food options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a lavish\Nfeast. Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.71,0:06:28.21,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.63,0:06:28.21,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H454E4D&\3c&HA7CEC6&}Deep-Fried Chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to go around, so\Njust wait your turn, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.22,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H314941&\3c&HA6CFC4&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And remember, be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children and old people go first,\Nso don't try to cut the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.25,0:06:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some sweet food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're gonna flip\Nwhen you taste this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, I doled out packaged prezzies\Nuntil the wee hours of the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we've got enough\NBoxxo food to last a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they're not going to starve,\Nwe can go catch up with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm told Captain Carriol's family\Nwent after the monster horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Director Bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, and Mishuel are in a mad dash to\Nbeat the beasts to the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better make sure you take a\Nlittle break if you need to, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live a little, Boxxo. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your hands to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know you've been through a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.87,0:07:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's probably a good idea\Nto take it easy for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those four stayed up all night with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.27,0:07:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't stop till the job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never change, do you, kiddo? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting so old you wake up\Nearly does have its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin's not porcine,\Nbut aging's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Collagen's overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The senior squad came equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks they want to tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me in too, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they're coming\Nalong for the ride, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate getting up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound like a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splash some water on your face\Nand pull yourself together, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our team will remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll work on rebuilding the town. Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I don't have to\Nworry about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm leaving it in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do men always sneak\Naway in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.53,0:08:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammy, please be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to give them help for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Steak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is everyone ready\Nto get going? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a tad silly to be\Nhiding behind a tree like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be able to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleased to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I deeply apologize for all the\Ntrouble my naughty son has caused you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who's this alleged\Nson you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ribby's pernicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my little rascal, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, lady, not to be mean, but is\NRibby in the room with us right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.77,0:09:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was a child, he was\Nso quiet and mild-mannered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you suppose I went wrong\Nfor him to turn out the way he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot, little Ribby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear he goes by a\Ndifferent name these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was, oh, now I\Nremember, the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nether Mama showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.61,0:09:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a plot twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know kids like to rebel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still can't believe he experimented
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on his own mother to\Nget that skeleton body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if that weren't bad enough,\Nhe also won't let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he be so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.65,0:10:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his own mother as a test\Nsubject for his twisted dark art!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Netherlord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you were mega-scum, but\Nthis is full-on psycho territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, a mother's love is eternal,\Nso I forgive him for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm the Thumb\NGeneral and I strike down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyone who dares to stand in my son's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a good mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so just to be clear,\Nare you gonna try and kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mother's love is nothing\Nif it's not unconditional!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lovely maternal\Nsentiment on paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't entail aiding mass murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems to me you're a\Nsorry excuse for a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.19,0:10:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a child is misbehaving, it's a\Nmother's duty to smack some sense into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation you just described isn't\Na mother's love, it's indulgence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.47,0:10:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you condemn me when\NI've given him everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you fool see that I'm\Nthe best mother there ever was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the world except\Nmy ribby and me can die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The apples didn't fall far from the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's clearly no point trying\Nto reason with the thumb, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who isn't fighting,\Nfollow me to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think we'd let\Nyou get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowards are ganging up on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.51,0:11:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.87,0:11:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,John, it's feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like the summoning\Ncircle the Netherlord used.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty clear where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a real bad feeling about that\Nsummoning circle, so watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.67,0:11:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it really be that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mana is downright alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be a monster from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:11:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Isekai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that weird monster-shaped thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen more than my fair\Nshare of monsters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that thing's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo! Boxxo! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.02,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(496,20)\fad(446,1)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.69,0:12:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.35,0:12:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave this nasty fella to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all itching to get in on the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you get as old as we are, you're\Ntoo short on time to bother with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, the two of you still\Nfind ways to scare me occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does get intense when\Nyou two are arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, now I'm doubly fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forces of justice\Nfighting back against evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is what dreams are made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:12:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, things are getting hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like these buggies like to\Nexplode whenever you blast them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.15,0:13:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this becomes a war of attrition,\Nstamina could be a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could distract our opponent\Nwith some kind of elaborate display wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a freaking vending machine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireworks are always something special,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing like\Nyour very first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the big bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really advancing, but it's\Nalso facing away from the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hunch was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:14:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thumb general is the one\Npulling its gross little strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.43,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply gorgeous. Lock it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you need something, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm ranked three,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can spawn concrete blocks\Nnearby instead of just under me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, you want me to throw these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the Thumb General. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned into a cardboard vending\Nmachine just before she threw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't get anywhere\Nnear the Thumb General.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I factored Lamas' bad\Naim into the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the? It's Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could watch them\Nwith my little ribby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our defeat of the Thumb General\Ncalls for a victory dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that would mean crashing\Nand burning, so maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.21,0:15:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I have an exit strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be in the clear now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this weird Field feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, you did something crazy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'm going to let you off\Nthe hook just because you're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it vanquished or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without its summoner\Nbinding it to this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that beast went back from whence it came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Textbook monster summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That takes care of, well, the side\Nstory, which still leaves the main plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry and\Ncatch up to our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mythical vehicle vending machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,famous amongst fellow\Nvending machine enthusiasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the uninitiated behold its glory,\Nthey often mistake it for a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, are you gonna give us another A-car?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our party's gotten pretty bloated,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the ground's not flat\Nlike the everlasting stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to take the bumpy\Nterrain into account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pickup truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That A-car looks different\Nfrom the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely a lot\Nbigger than our old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.21,0:16:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of these roads are uneven, so I know\Ndispensing a truck was the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room\Neven with yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's a foreign build, the\Nstandard size is still huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really starting to\Nlike driving this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasant drive,\Nbut it's almost lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I should\Nfeed my friends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.97,0:17:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I know just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pals are in for a tasty treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pizza vending machine baked to\Norder with all the right topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.23,0:17:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an authentic Italian model.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this crazy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pull it apart and it gets so stretchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was such a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ate it all in record time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hold out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pop out the good stuff already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, someone's addicted, but I only vend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.01,0:17:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy everyone loves my\Nhot and ready pizza so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They barely touched their zah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be too heavy for their\Nancient tummies to handle.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (big; left),0,0,0,,{\pos(292,103)\c&H32312C&\3c&HEDEAED&\shad0\bord4\fs24\fad(527,1)}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (big; right),0,0,0,,{\c&H32312C&\3c&HEDEAED&\shad0\bord2\fs24\pos(397,93)\fad(527,1)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of you to\Nfuss over us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.75,0:17:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing was interesting,\Nbut just a little too rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for thinking of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I hate to waste\Nperfectly good food. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, those are all\Nyours if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm dreaming, you'll be here\Ntill I'm done eating, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shui, your stomach's\Nas bottomless as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.49,0:18:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll load her up on lots of burgers and\Nfried chicken before we hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, can I have\None of those fizzy drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to devise a plan\Nto stop the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His powers are a pain in the\Nrear, but with all these points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could use\Nmy barrier to blow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my tummy's feeling a little\Nangry, so how about a little snack?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.36,sign_Verdana,text (1st box),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H9C9CB7&\3c&HB3BDB4&\shad0\bord4\fs15}Tater-\NTater\NFries
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.36,sign_Verdana,text (2nd box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H797776&\3c&H8B8581&\shad0\bord4}Pasta\Nwith Cream Sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.61,0:18:34.36,sign_Arial,text (4th box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H756C65&\3c&HABA29A&\shad0\fax0.02\fs10\pos(531,188)\frz330.7\fad231,1)}Egg Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait to attack\Nuntil his tummy's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, focus! Let's think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the Finger Generals, I've defeated\Nthe thumb and the middle fingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring finger General\NSulream switched sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, I'm still starving over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.87,sign_Arial,text (2nd box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4C211E&\3c&H7F7A74&\shad0\fax0.02\fs10\frz-30.96\fad(231,1)\pos(337,259)}Ham Sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.29,0:18:49.87,sign_Arial,text (4th box),0,0,0,,{\frz20.11\fax-0.06\c&H4C211E&\3c&H615B58&\fs15\shad0\pos(239,320)\fad(108,1)}Cream Puff
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The diabetes-inducing\Nsweetbread general... Dadnobbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.45,0:18:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the last two\Ngenerals will be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pinky general got away, and there's\Nno telling where the forefinger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need something really sweet to help\Nwash down all that tasty food now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's the dreaded juice general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you stop distracting me, Shui?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am this close to letting Hulemy\Ndissect your stomach for science.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.91,0:19:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting any less thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shwee's had enough sugar\Nto kill a grown elephant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let's try a zero-calorie beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.23,0:19:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is something off\Nabout the sweetness of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tastes okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She not only eats a lot, but it seems\Nher sense of taste is also shockingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and annoyingly refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking something\Nrude, are you, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.55,0:19:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaining what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.31,0:19:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's gaining weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.45,0:19:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of\Na bulking phase, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fat Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.75,0:19:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's against the law to\Ntalk about a girl's weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The road trip went smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No accidents or illegal\Nfat comments to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only took us a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This contraption sure is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see things in the\Nfar-off distance clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to revel\Nin the glory of vending.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.23,0:20:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you. Up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.99,0:20:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a standoff against\Na horde of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.51,0:20:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have a gander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not loving their odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.01,0:20:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor saps are outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're way out here, does\Nthat mean what I think it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, head right and make\Nthis thing go even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all kinds of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them packed so tightly together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be too dangerous\Nto try a magic strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we'd try to set it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.15,0:20:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shui Lion Director Scorching\Ncan't push the wind button?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably tell Hulemy\Nto find somewhere safe to park.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.23,0:20:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, hold on to your butts, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, move it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd find them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.61,0:20:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should've known you'd show\Nup just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's move the wounded\Ninside Voxo's barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can still move, carry\Nsomebody who can't inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you healed up in a jiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You as well, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too hot to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ding bong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching my friends commit acts of\Nviolence reminds me how lucky I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're OP compared to other hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I don't mean\Nto bust out my arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not wrong, but she's also not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to put that lazy tushy to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you gotta be so mean, Boxo? Chewy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't I teach you if you\Nhave time to run your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have time to pull your weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, you said it a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, is it just me or is\NChewy frightened of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, I should stop dwelling on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.47,0:21:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, the battle ended in victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my friends laying the\Nsmack down on those jabronis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final battle is almost upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, I could use a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there?
