Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for watching.
